1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:03,060
(Sheldon(behind them):)I don't want to shake
anyone's germy hands.

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,560
(Sheldon(behind them):)Explain it to
them, Siebert.

3
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:12,910
(Sheldon(on phone):)I must confess

4
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,510
(Sheldon(on phone):)I don't understand you,
President Siebert.

5
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:17,280
(Sheldon(on phone):)First you say you want me
to appear at your fund-raisers,

6
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,790
(Sheldon(on phone):)but now you say
you never want me to go

7
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:21,520
(Sheldon(on phone):)anywhere near your fund-raisers.

8
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:24,520
(Sheldon(on phone):)Forgive me, but that sounds
like a mixed message.

9
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,120
(Sheldon(on phone):)Here we go again.

10
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,290
(Sheldon(on phone):)If there's simply
no talking to me,

11
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:31,360
(Sheldon(on phone):)why did you call?

12
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,230
(Sheldon(on phone):)I'm sorry, someone's
on the other line.

13
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,800
(Sheldon(on phone):)Why don't you see if you
can organize your thoughts,

14
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,940
(Sheldon(on phone):)and we'll try again later.

15
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:41,570
(Sheldon(on phone):)Cooper-Hofstadter residence.
Go for Cooper.

16
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,670
Good morning, Mrs. Latham.

17
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:45,810
Well, yes, of course
I remember you.

18
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:47,480
A woman well past her prime

19
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,380
seeking to augment
her social status

20
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:52,320
by doling out her late husband's
ill-gotten gains.

21
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:57,250
So, how much money
are you going to give me?

22
00:00:57,250 --> 00:01:00,590
I'm not crazy--
my mother had me tested.

